# Solver-backed `explain-rejection` — configflux-3b5y / ADR-0031 D1–D4.
# Compiles the mutually-exclusive solver fixture, opens a runtime session,
# and proves: (a) explaining a constraint-violating value returns a labeled
# `unsat_core` with `{facet}.{option}` names at exit 0; (b) explaining a
# valid value succeeds at exit 0 with no core; (c) an unknown facet/value
# fails closed at exit 2 with `E_SELECTION_UNKNOWN_FACET` and no core.
# Product-stack + system tagged (E2E impact: smoke).
